  "bodyHash": "6495e3fafcc5d878",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《斜向栅栏》使各类栅栏均支持对角线连接。功能完全符合您的预期，无需多言。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">其他模组添加的方块将在可能的情况下动态获得支持。若不希望某些方块被意外影响，可将其加入 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">diagonalfences:non_diagonal_fences</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 方块标签中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">欢迎体验“斜向方块”模组系列的另外两款作品： </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-windows\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Diagonal Windows</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 和 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Diagonal Walls</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模组可与 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（作者 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrcrayfish\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MrCrayfish</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）及 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/macaws-fences-and-walls\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Macaw's Fences and Walls</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（作者 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Sketch_Macaw</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）等模组完美兼容。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 与 NeoForge 版）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 版）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 版）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可直接在游戏内通过模组菜单进行配置（Fabric 平台需安装 Prospector 开发的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需额外安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在，部分模组可能完全没有此类文件。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/theweatherpony\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">TheWeatherPony</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fence-overhaul\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fence Overhaul</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组中提供的设计灵感。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/magneticflux_\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Magneticflux</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 从其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-panes\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Diagonal Panes</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组中分享的斜向碰撞箱相关代码。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特别感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xfacthd\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">XFactHD</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 将本模组移植至 1.18 版本，贡献了斜向模型代码，并在整体开发过程中提供了诸多帮助！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/portable-hole\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/portablehole/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/illager-invasion\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
